strong>Stick & Play:<\/strong> PowerSpots adhere to any smooth surface, creating endless ways to play.<\/p><p><strong>Strategize & Score:<\/strong> Each PowerSpot has a unique rule—use them wisely to dominate the game.<\/p><p><strong>Win Your Way:<\/strong> The game ends when a player hits exactly <strong>21 points<\/strong>—so aim sharp, think smart, and bring the heat!<\/p><h5>PowerSpots at a glance: <\/h5><p>🎯 <strong>Instant Win:<\/strong> Hit this spot to win the game instantly. (3 inches)<br\/>🔄 <strong>Swap:<\/strong> Swap scores with your opponent—just when they thought they had it! (4 inches)<br\/>✖️ <strong>Multiplier:<\/strong> Multiply your dart's points by the number of standing darts. (4 inches)<br\/>➕ <strong>Double:<\/strong> Double the points scored with this spot. (4.5 inches)<br\/>🦴 <strong>DogBone Hunter:<\/strong> Make an opponent’s dart the “Dogbone.” (4.5 inches)<br\/>🌊 <strong>Wash:<\/strong> Reset both players' points to zero—hello, fresh start! (5 inches)<br\/>🕶️ <strong>Blind Spot:<\/strong> Opponent throws their next dart blindfolded—good luck! (5 inches)<br\/>💣 <strong>Bomb:<\/strong> Kaboom! The player who hits this loses the game. (5.5 inches)<br\/>🎲 <strong>Double Trouble:<\/strong> Cuts points in half—high risk, high reward. (6 inches)<br\/>🌀 <strong>Black Hole:<\/strong> Darts landing here are out of play for the rest of the game. (6 inches)<\/p>","page":"","default_open":true}},"collapsible_tab_CyXkFT":{"type":"collapsible_tab","settings":{"heading":"SHIPPING & RETURNS","icon":"package","content":"<ul><li><strong>All Popdarts® orders ship next business day. <\/strong><\/li><li>Standard shipping in the USA takes 3-5 business days.<\/li><li>Returns are easy. Simply contact us at <a href=\"mailto:support@popdartsgame.com\" target=\"_blank\" title=\"mailto:support@popdartsgame.com\">support@popdartsgame.com<\/a>.<\/li><\/ul>","page":"","default_open":false}}},"block_order":["title","badges","judge_me_reviews_preview_badge_wwWAiq","pric